  "family": "cryogen-free (Cryofree) optical cryostat for spectroscopy",
  "description": "Compact cryogen-free optical cryostat offered in two variants: BLV (bottom-loading, sample in vacuum, <3 K to 300 K, 28 mm f/1 clear view) and TLEX (top-loading, sample in static exchange gas, <4 K to 300 K, 15 mm f/1 clear view). Four radial Spectrosil WF windows plus one axial blank are fitted as standard; base temperature with four windows fitted is 6.5 K. Air- or water-cooled compressor. All nanoscience.oxinst.com product URLs redirect to qd-oxford.com.",
